#8800
Credits Room~
   This area was written by Rail for the purpose of creating an
interesting area for the intended levels of 30+.
Date of creation:  May 1998 - November 1998
Summer break prevented me from finishing the area earlier
Name of area:      The Hogweeds

Change Log - Done by Xiuhtecuhtli 09/2006
*Linked another part of area to Grasslands. 
*Changed mobile descriptions to make them more suitable for the area
*Added a mobile that walks around with a light in the "Wooded Clearing"
*Changed small and seedling mobiles to clerics.
*Fixed grammar and spelling errors.
*Added meld item to Guardian spirit, when melded with Plate of Solamnus --> 8825.
~
