#8801
Path to the Town~
   You are standing in the shade of several small trees.  The path
underfoot is strangely overgrown and unused.  Though no chirping or
any other natural sound can be heard, the bushes seem to rustle
uneasily and the plants seem to exude malevolence.  To the North you
see a small village.  There is a small wooden sign hammered rather
sloppily into the ground here.
~
