sign small wooden~

   O--------------------------------------------------O
   | WARNING!                                         |
   |                                                  |
   | The village North of here has been overrun       |
   | by hogweeds.  Enter at your own risk!            |
   |                                                  |
   | Rail                                             |
   |                                                  |
   | P.S. If you enjoy this area please let me know.  |
   O------------------------------------------------- O
~
