#8811
A Well Furnished House~
   Deep red rugs cover the floor, Paintings obviously done by children
hang from the walls, and wooden furniture is scattered throughout the
house.  You bend down to get a better look at the rugs, but you don't
quite make it all the way.  Halfway down you realize that the carpet
wasn't always red.  It used to be white, but is now completely covered
in dried blood.
~
