#8813
Town Square~
   You find yourself standing in the town square, where the villagers
used to hold town meetings and picnics.  The sound of childrens'
laughter can almost still be heard among all of this death and
destruction.  A path leads off the square through town to the North and
another to the South.  To the West is a small quiet house and to the
East is a small shop.
~
