#8815
A Small House~
   Stale air greets your nose as you enter this house.  What someone might
expect in a small house like this is exactly what you see.  A small bed stands
in the corner, a wooden table rests in the center of the room with a chair next
to it, and a small dresser lies over turned on the floor.  The ceiling is bare
except for a small outline that looks like it might be a hatch.    
~
