#8821
The Church~
   Rays of light drift lazily through the air, highlighted by dust in the air,
and let in through holes in the ceiling.  Pews are lined up in neatly ordered
rows on either side of you.  A strange feeling of peace drifts through the air
as you stand in the unbroken silence.  One more thing of interest in the
church, is a large mural on the west wall.    
~
88 131100 0 0 0 1 255 0
D2
The shadow from the church slants back onto a path.
~
~
0 0 8819
E
mural painting~
   The mural is a beautiful landscape of the lands of Solamnia.  Two knights
dominate the center of attention.  One you have never seen before, the other
knight can only be the renowned Sir Ratleif.  The unknown knight wears a
beautiful set of armor, interestingly enough, you seem to remember this armor
bring worn in the present day by Ratleif...    
~
